# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CardioSentry — what stays out of the repo
#
# This repo shares the DATASET GENERATOR (the pipeline code), not the data.
# Every dataset here is licence-gated (PhysioNet credentialed / DUA) and must
# be obtained by each user directly from the source. Nothing is redistributed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python environment ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Source datasets (~11 GB, licence-gated) ---
# Obtain your own copies and point config/paths.yaml at them.
dataset-files/

# --- Generated dataset artefacts (~57 GB, reproducible by running the pipeline) ---
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/data/

# --- Staged datasets: decoded waveforms + index (reproducible from
#     dataset-files/ by re-running dataset-staging/*/scripts/) ---
#     Scripts, configs, READMEs and the small reports ARE tracked.
dataset-staging/cuhk/data/signals/
dataset-staging/cuhk/data/index/
dataset-staging/*/reports/conversion.log
dataset-staging/*/reports/validate.log
dataset-staging/*/reports/audit_signal_stats.csv

# --- Standalone CUHK release (2.2 GB, rebuild with make_clean_release.py) ---
dataset-files/cuhk_dataset_clean/

# --- Upstream third-party checkout (631 MB, clone it separately) ---
# https://github.com/alphanumericslab/ecg-image-kit
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/ecg-image-kit/

# --- Separate project with its own repo ---
# https://github.com/LedgeA/ECG-diagnosis-prototype
dataset-combination-code/ECG-diagnosis-prototype/

# --- Image pipeline build products ---
build/
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/image_pipeline/build.log

# --- Bulky generated reports (regenerated by a pipeline run) ---
# The small summary/audit reports in reports/ ARE committed, on purpose.
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/extracted_candidates.csv
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/excluded_records.csv
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/signal_compatibility_report.csv
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/harmonization_report.csv
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/ambiguity_report.csv
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/duplicate_patient_report.csv

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CardioSentry web application — tracked by its OWN repository
# (github.com/lindtseyyy/cardiosentry-application), not by this one:
#   cardiosentry-application/        PostgreSQL build, branch main
#   cardiosentry-application-local/  JSON-storage build, branch local-json
#                                    (git worktree of the same repository)
# Its own .gitignore keeps captures/ (photographs of real ECG sheets may carry
# printed patient identifiers, plan §19.4), .env and models/weights/ out of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/cardiosentry-application/
/cardiosentry-application-local/
captures_export.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Results and experiment output — CODE AND NOTEBOOKS ONLY
#
# This repo ships the source that produces the work, not the work's output.
# prototype-results/ is excluded outright. experiments/ keeps only its source
# (.py / .ipynb / .sh / .md / config) — every rendered sheet, figure, metric
# CSV, prediction dump and checkpoint under it stays out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Model checkpoints (~3.9 GB; 20 files exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit) ---
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# --- Training run output (~4.0 GB) ---
# Metrics, figures, prediction CSVs and checkpoints from every prototype run.
# The notebooks that produced them are tracked under prototype-code/.
prototype-results/

# --- Experiment output (~1.1 GB) ---
# Ignore the whole tree, then re-admit source files only. The `**/` negation
# is required: git will not descend into an excluded directory, so the
# directories must be re-included before the files inside them can be.
experiments/**
!experiments/**/
!experiments/**/*.py
!experiments/**/*.ipynb
!experiments/**/*.sh
!experiments/**/*.md
!experiments/**/*.toml
!experiments/**/*.yaml
!experiments/**/*.yml
!experiments/**/*.cfg
!experiments/**/README*.txt
!experiments/**/.gitignore

# Re-exclude things the negations above would otherwise drag back in.
experiments/**/__pycache__/
experiments/_colab_bundle/pkg/ecg-image-kit/

# --- Bulky staged metadata (rebuild with dataset-staging/cuhk/scripts/) ---
dataset-staging/cuhk/data/cuhk_metadata.csv
dataset-staging/cuhk/reports/label_decisions.csv
dataset-staging/cuhk/reports/excluded_records.csv
dataset-staging/cuhk/reports/conversion_report.csv

# --- Per-run pipeline logs (~45 MB of snapshots) ---
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/logs/
dataset-combination-code/ecg-dataset-pipeline/reports/v3_precheck.csv

# --- Python packaging / test caches ---
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
